{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1331548-heaven-for-everyone-exalted-in-owod-actual-play","id":1331548,"title":"Heaven For Everyone (Exalted in oWoD actual play)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-08-18T22:16:03-07:00","id":1331548,"title":"Heaven For Everyone (Exalted in oWoD actual play)","content":"We've recently started a new Exalted actual play - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/category/ap-heaven-for-everyone/\" target=\"_blank\">Heaven For Everyone</a>. It's a cross between Exalted and V20 / Wraith20 - a group of teens in the 1980s Los Angeles get turned into Exalts. They start taking in the Old World of Darkness as they try figuring out what they are, all the while putting local vampires in their place and keeping a low profile as teenagers in a high school (we wanted the game to have a slower burn, so we didn't go straight to being god-kings <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ).<br /> <br /> Our plan for the game is to eventually face off against the end-of-the-world metaplot and see how things shape up, but for the first season we're just dealing with local problems.<br /> <br /> Our cast consists of:<br /> - Brass Dancer, an Infernal<br /> - Creation Ruling Mandate, a Sidereal Chosen of Secrets<br /> - Princess Magnificent, a Midnight Caste Abyssal<br /> - Salt Spray Purity, a Solar Dawn<br /> <br /> You can find our introduction episode here:<br /> - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-introduction/\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-introduction/</a><br /> <br /> And our first actual episode is here:<br /> - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-01/\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...01-episode-01/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-30T16:34:23-07:00","id":1333321,"title":"","content":"Second Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-02\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-02</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods audition at a talent agency to confront a vampire that has been abducting people, take a math test, and send spectres to haunt school bullies. You know, normal teenage stuff <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .<br /> <br /> <br /> Third Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-03\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-03</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods deal with a kidnapped vampire, lie to a child about the Easter Bunny, learn about the Toreadore conspiracy, have some vampire feeding experiments and make sure our former child actor Exalt gets her homework when she decides to skip class. Also talk about morality, as all our Exalts do <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T03:55:53-07:00","id":1336177,"title":"","content":"Fourth Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-04\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-04</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods flash their collective animas to an unsuspecting war veteran celebrity (it's okay, he's a vampire), the Lunar goes for their first glorious hunt, there is a school trip to a museum, someone does a cat burglary, and our Atrocity of Exalts stop a museum from being robbed as they are robbing the museum, and someone gets a new pet, which comes with a lot of responsibilities as it turns out...<br /> <br /> <br /> Fifth Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-05\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-05</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods find out you can be double-kidnapped, visit a lovely heritage home, ruin an art auction, realise how much logistics is involved after you kidnap people, and have a chat with Bela Lugosi about the Gehenna - typical teenage stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T07:55:18-07:00","id":1337093,"title":"","content":"Sixth Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-06\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-06</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods figure out how to deal with a pet fire breathing babylonian vampire-serpent, including socialising it with other vampires (it doesn't go well) and feeding it (also doesn't go well). The Exalts also get a help from a war veteran in dealing with everyone they kidnapped, the Sidereal finds a way to manage his Arcane Fate having a bad effect on his school attendance, and the Atrocity of Exalts meet with the local orphan vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-27T08:00:26-07:00","id":1338139,"title":"","content":"Seventh Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-07\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-07</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods learn some american history and teach the value of being careful what you wish for. It might end up costing you a part of your soul, or turn into a monkeypaw. Also, don't try having fancy parties when someone is trying to steal your fancy display car, those tend to attract spectres.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-04T17:53:39-07:00","id":1339481,"title":"","content":"Eighth Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-08\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-08</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods dress up for Christmass, rob a bank, play with some Etch a Sketches, confront paramilitary ghost hunters and get a santa's bag full of dirt on a lot of local vampires, all at the same time. It's a bad night to be working at Clementine Bank\u2019s Consortium...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T18:32:33-07:00","id":1340882,"title":"","content":"Ninth Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-09\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-09</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods investigate a new cult that's cleaning up the streets of Caitiffs, buy a car, investigate a mysterious organisation totally not ripped off from some other franchise, cause a hostage situation and be shitty to a teacher, like any rebelious teenagers would.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T09:06:24-07:00","id":1342091,"title":"","content":"Tenth Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-10\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-10</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods use their godly powers to make school life easier, look themselves up in Black Dog RPG manuals, deal with a &quot;broken&quot; school bully and an undisciplined spectre, discuss the difference between a gargoyle and a grotesque while blackmailing a vampire that's one of these, and have a showdown. Typical life of a teenager.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T19:29:30-07:00","id":1342253,"title":"","content":"I absolutely loved Princes of the Universe and I've only listened to the first few episodes of Heaven for Everyone but I'm really enjoying your group dynamic and everyone. Sad to not have Anthony being goofy but so far the characters are amazing. Thanks for making these.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4390-deamonlight","name":"Deamonlight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T23:47:49-07:00","id":1342888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deamonlight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1331548-heaven-for-everyone-exalted-in-owod-actual-play?p=1342253#post1342253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I absolutely loved Princes of the Universe and I've only listened to the first few episodes of Heaven for Everyone but I'm really enjoying your group dynamic and everyone. Sad to not have Anthony being goofy but so far the characters are amazing. Thanks for making these.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey Deamonlight, glad you're enjoying our new series! We miss Anthony too, he brought a lot of good energy with him to the table <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-25T09:44:02-07:00","id":1343603,"title":"","content":"Eleventh Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-11\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-11</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods enjoy their white Christmas. Brass Dancer networks with vampires at a charity event, Salt Spray Purity cuts down a definitely not cursed tree and wrestles a bear, while Creation Ruling Mandate and Princess Magnificent get high while chaperoning a class of deaf kids in a winter shalet while someone dares to burgle the place and Home Alone hijinks ensue. Typical 80s Christmas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-25T12:36:30-07:00","id":1343630,"title":"","content":"I'm amused just how heavily you guys have leaned into this &quot;Yeah there's totally snow in LA&quot; angle xD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic","name":"Dragonmystic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-27T12:13:31-07:00","id":1344042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragonmystic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1331548-heaven-for-everyone-exalted-in-owod-actual-play?p=1343630#post1343630\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm amused just how heavily you guys have leaned into this &quot;Yeah there's totally snow in LA&quot; angle xD</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a fun running gag <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> . Our GM just transplanted the weather from his Canadian home town and rolled with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T19:44:13-07:00","id":1345374,"title":"","content":"Twelfth Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-12\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-12</a><br /> <br /> In this episode our teenage demigods decide to perform a Christmass miracle or two. Heal some sick children, stumble upon a black site, find some coma patients that decided to talk off with the aid of some &quot;friends&quot;, celebrate the New Years with a bang, meet James Bond, and have a dream about an old friend...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T09:19:01-08:00","id":1347048,"title":"","content":"Thirteenth Episode of Heaven for Everyone, our modern Exalted game is out - <a href=\"https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.com/e/exalted-heaven-for-everyone-season-01-episode-13\" target=\"_blank\">https://sponsoredbynobody.podbean.co...-01-episode-13</a><br /> <br /> It's our outro episode! We talk about the game we had, how the system worked out, and everything inbetween.<br /> <br /> If anyone missed the game, we also have a YouTube playlist for you - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLUmXD25c9QntBEjosxGWv8UZrlxpQmdCo\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?lis...Wv8UZrlxpQmdCo</a> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12211-thepiachu","name":"ThePiachu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}